OL,3,GNEWSAFire breaks out at town centre
OL,4,Anightclub
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews from across Shropshire have
OL,7,Ftackled a blaze which ripped through a
OL,8,Fnightclub.
OL,10,FSix crews were called to Mainstreet
OL,11,FNightclub in Newport at 23.11GMT on
OL,12,FSaturday and found the first and second
OL,13,Ffloors of the building alight.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for Shropshire Fire and
OL,16,FRescue Service said when crews arrived
OL,17,Fsmoke could be seen pouring from the
OL,18,FHigh Street building but everyone
OL,19,Finside was accounted for.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
